$ jailops profile delete -y base
! busy: profile "base" is used by jail "nginx"
! hint: Wait for the running operation ('jailops op list') and retry. (jailops explain busy)
[exit 5]

$ jailops delete -y nginx
jail/nginx deleted

$ jailops profile delete -y base
profile/base deleted

$ jailops --project host profile list
! No resources found.

